Z||000000||SloPonti||03-22-2000||12:37 AM||||here is my new project that i am starting on since i got my new motor back in and running good! my girlfriend is in to camaros and she bought this 87 iroc z28 to replace her 86 camaro 6 cylinder! this car was wrecked in the front end-i got this car for 1,200 bucks-hell of a deal!!! i also bought a cheap 88 iroc with no motor for 400 bucks and took off the front end to fix mine and sold the rest of the 88 piece by piece over the internet and made 600.00-also great deal! so i have all pieces to fix the car! i also did the valve seals on this car so that it did not have that lovely blue smoke on startups like most common camaros do! right now i am in the process of striping it down and getting it ready for paint! the girl in one of the pictures is my girlfriend whom i have been seeing now for 3 and a half years!<BR>thanks and let me know what you think!<BR>Rob   <A HREF="http://members.aol.com/sloponti/iroc1.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://members.aol.com/sloponti/iroc1.jpg</A>  <A HREF="http://members.aol.com/sloponti/iroc2.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://members.aol.com/sloponti/iroc2.jpg</A>  <A HREF="http://members.aol.com/sloponti/car3.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://members.aol.com/sloponti/car3.jpg</A>  <A HREF="http://members.aol.com/sloponti/iroc4.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://members.aol.com/sloponti/iroc4.jpg</A> <P><p>[This message has been edited by SloPonti (edited 03-22-2000).]||||reg||1
